# 🧩 Modular State Transition Services Architecture

## 📋 The Problem

Currently, state services are **monolithic** – each file handles ALL side effects for an entity:

```
CustomerStateService.js (350+ lines)
├── onCreate()          // welcome email, UI broadcast, audit
├── onStatusChange()    // notifications, audit
├── onPointsChange()    // notifications, audit
├── earnPoints()        // business logic + side effects
├── redeemPoints()      // business logic + side effects
├── manualAdjustPoints()// business logic + side effects
├── _notifyStatusChange() // email, SMS, in-app
├── _determineStatus()  // business logic
└── getLoyaltyHistory() // read-only
```

**Problems:**
- ❌ Mixed responsibilities (business logic + side effects)
- ❌ Hard to test (mock everything)
- ❌ Hard to reuse (cannot import individual functions)
- ❌ Hard to maintain (changes affect everything)
- ❌ Large files (350+ lines per service)

---

## 🎯 Proposed Modular Architecture

### Principle: **Single Responsibility**

Each module handles ONE specific concern:

```
src/stateServices/
├── customer/
│   ├── CustomerStateService.js       // Orchestrator (imports modules)
│   ├── modules/
│   │   ├── CustomerStatusModule.js   // Status transitions
│   │   ├── CustomerPointsModule.js   // Points operations (business logic)
│   │   ├── CustomerNotificationModule.js // Email/SMS/In-app
│   │   └── CustomerAuditModule.js    // Audit logging
│   └── index.js                      // Re-exports
├── sale/
│   ├── SaleStateService.js           // Orchestrator
│   ├── modules/
│   │   ├── SaleInventoryModule.js    // Stock deduction/restock
│   │   ├── SaleLoyaltyModule.js      // Points earn/redeem
│   │   ├── SaleNotificationModule.js // Notifications
│   │   └── SalePaymentModule.js      // Receipt, cash drawer
│   └── index.js
├── purchase/
│   ├── PurchaseStateService.js       // Orchestrator
│   ├── modules/
│   │   ├── PurchaseStatusModule.js   // Status transitions
│   │   ├── PurchaseNotificationModule.js // Supplier notifications
│   │   └── PurchaseAuditModule.js    // Audit logging
│   └── index.js
├── batch/
│   ├── BatchStateService.js          // Orchestrator
│   └── modules/
│       ├── BatchStatusModule.js      // Status transitions
│       ├── BatchNotificationModule.js // Notifications
│       └── BatchAuditModule.js       // Audit logging
└── common/
    ├── NotificationSender.js         // Email/SMS service (shared)
    ├── UIBroadcaster.js              // IPC events (shared)
    └── AuditLogger.js                // Audit logging (shared)
```

---

## 🔧 Implementation Guide

### Step 1: Create Common Shared Modules

#### `src/stateServices/common/UIBroadcaster.js`

```javascript
// src/stateServices/common/UIBroadcaster.js
const { logger } = require("../../utils/logger");

class UIBroadcaster {
  /**
   * Send event to all renderer windows (UI)
   * @param {string} channel - IPC channel name
   * @param {any} data - Data to send
   */
  static send(channel, data) {
    try {
      const { BrowserWindow } = require("electron");
      const windows = BrowserWindow.getAllWindows();
      windows.forEach((win) => {
        if (!win.isDestroyed()) {
          win.webContents.send(channel, data);
        }
      });
    } catch (error) {
      logger.warn(
        `[UIBroadcaster] Failed to send IPC event (maybe not in Electron):`,
        error.message,
      );
    }
  }

  /**
   * Broadcast batch events
   */
  static batch(action, data) {
    const channel = `batch:${action}`;
    this.send(channel, data);
  }

  /**
   * Broadcast customer events
   */
  static customer(action, data) {
    const channel = `customer:${action}`;
    this.send(channel, data);
  }

  /**
   * Broadcast sale events
   */
  static sale(action, data) {
    const channel = `sale:${action}`;
    this.send(channel, data);
  }

  /**
   * Broadcast purchase events
   */
  static purchase(action, data) {
    const channel = `purchase:${action}`;
    this.send(channel, data);
  }

  /**
   * Broadcast return/refund events
   */
  static returnRefund(action, data) {
    const channel = `returnRefund:${action}`;
    this.send(channel, data);
  }

  /**
   * Broadcast loyalty events
   */
  static loyalty(action, data) {
    const channel = `loyalty:${action}`;
    this.send(channel, data);
  }

  /**
   * Broadcast notification events
   */
  static notification(action, data) {
    const channel = `notification:${action}`;
    this.send(channel, data);
  }

  /**
   * Broadcast supplier events
   */
  static supplier(action, data) {
    const channel = `supplier:${action}`;
    this.send(channel, data);
  }

  /**
   * Broadcast category events
   */
  static category(action, data) {
    const channel = `category:${action}`;
    this.send(channel, data);
  }

  /**
   * Broadcast meat events
   */
  static meat(action, data) {
    const channel = `meat:${action}`;
    this.send(channel, data);
  }

  /**
   * Broadcast inventory movement events
   */
  static inventoryMovement(action, data) {
    const channel = `inventoryMovement:${action}`;
    this.send(channel, data);
  }
}

module.exports = UIBroadcaster;
```

